  "ingredients": [
    "1 (3 pound) whole chicken",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted",
    "1 tablespoon salt",
    "1 tablespoon ground paprika",
    "0.25 tablespoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an outdoor grill for high heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mFMqdMvPs0tZmlSOukeqKmgeJZA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-93168-rotisserie-chicken-step-01-8837b6c2a9e049caa6cddc404049b0be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/93168/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season chicken cavity with a pinch of salt. Tie legs together with kitchen string; then tie wings to the bird. Secure chicken on a rotisserie attachment.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VN2RACgE2tX8bpRmm6dMYXp5GKM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-93168-rotisserie-chicken-step-02-d129a31be0034a5e9697a05a1fa04a09.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/93168/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place rotisserie over the preheated grill and cook for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hono71nRyqRi23yIeJEEzH0cYiM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-93168-rotisserie-chicken-step-03-bf2ef29b2c544425bfae5d2118137dd0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/93168/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, quickly mix together butter, 1 tablespoon of salt, paprika, and pepper. Turn the grill down to medium and baste chicken with butter mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mxhVoLh7Qex7V_htlm6Y2bXh8tw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-93168-rotisserie-chicken-step-04-090fd88f224a40efb943ce66c2f237e9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/93168/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Close the lid and cook over medium heat, basting occasionally, until chicken is cooked through and the internal temperature reaches 180 degrees F (83 degrees C), 1 to 1 1/2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_hnoQvBw5S2r3LvhVDafYseeT5o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-93168-rotisserie-chicken-step-05-957a6b602a804f578859c416de30fe32.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/93168/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove chicken from the rotisserie and let rest for 10 to 15 minutes before carving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/13buLyC0M4vSKPYcbrSd4QbKo2w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-93168-rotisserie-chicken-hero-4x3-ee1ae8718d494a21bba95c996604a077.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/93168/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
